Z||000003||Wolfhound||07-17-2001||04:18 PM||||This interior will be Black and tan when finished. I used the flat black plastic vinyl spray on the third brake light just to get a feel for how it will spray out.<BR> The tan will be custom mixed at a auto paint and body supply in Opelika to match the leather. Williams Black and tan interior was the inspiration.  <p>[This message has been edited by Wolfhound (edited 07-17-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000004||Wolfhound||07-17-2001||04:25 PM||||Cheevers, I applied the vinyl with it,s glue wet. It gave me a bit of wiggle room to adjust it.||||reg||1
