Z||000007||Wolfhound||07-18-2001||04:44 AM||||Radar, Yes the solvents actually made it more pliable. It may not have been able to form around the interior light shape otherwise.<P> Thanks for pointing that out. I intended to follow up on that in the original post.<P>The vinyl came from Wal-Mart and was $3.75 for 54x36. They have a gray that is a good match to the original. both are semi-gloss.<BR>I,ll get a shot in better light later today and post it.<P>||||reg||1
